1
00:00:07,845 --> 00:00:10,650
This is Part 4 of 6: The taste.

2
00:00:11,449 --> 00:00:15,676
So far I have looked at why dependent
arising is stranger than it sounds,

3
00:00:15,756 --> 00:00:18,135
what it says, and what it is for.

4
00:00:18,215 --> 00:00:20,920
One of its uses is to describe a taste.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,922
This part is about that taste.

6
00:00:23,741 --> 00:00:27,071
Dependent arising did not
come to me first as a view.

7
00:00:27,151 --> 00:00:30,839
It came as a taste, and the
view came to sync with it later.

8
00:00:31,641 --> 00:00:35,270
Looked back on, the taste
was met three times:

9
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:39,672
right after anatta, again when
every hinge was exhausted,

10
00:00:39,752 --> 00:00:41,674
and again in the marketplace.

11
00:00:42,493 --> 00:00:47,213
Start with anatta. In anatta
there is only seeing, no seer.

12
00:00:47,302 --> 00:00:50,592
Hearing, no hearer. The
agent is seen through.

13
00:00:50,672 --> 00:00:52,716
It was never there from its own side.

14
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,984
But then: what are seeing and hearing?

15
00:00:56,064 --> 00:00:58,660
We say they are events, processes.

16
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,351
That is true, but it is still words.

17
00:01:01,431 --> 00:01:03,121
So look, in real time.

18
00:01:03,933 --> 00:01:09,835
Seeing is just colours. No effort at all.
Hearing is just sound. No effort at all.

19
00:01:10,633 --> 00:01:14,574
Nothing is doing the seeing, and
the seeing is not being done.

20
00:01:14,654 --> 00:01:18,610
Even what we called a process does
not seem to be a process at all.

21
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:24,063
Nothing runs underneath the colours,
carrying them from one moment to the next.

22
00:01:24,869 --> 00:01:26,569
And the colours are not dark.

23
00:01:26,649 --> 00:01:29,082
They are clear, known and vivid.

24
00:01:29,162 --> 00:01:31,134
The knowing is right there in the colour,

25
00:01:31,214 --> 00:01:33,906
and nothing stands behind it, knowing.

26
00:01:33,986 --> 00:01:36,501
Clarity is not added to the taste.

27
00:01:36,581 --> 00:01:39,807
It is just not lifted out
and made into a knower.

28
00:01:40,630 --> 00:01:45,876
So here, right after anatta, is a
first taste of spontaneous presence.

29
00:01:45,956 --> 00:01:50,510
Immediate, effortless and
spontaneous. Remember this taste.

30
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:52,009
I will come back to it.

31
00:01:52,813 --> 00:01:56,157
How is this different from
a refined non-dual state?

32
00:01:56,237 --> 00:01:59,173
A refined non-dual rests in oneness.

33
00:01:59,253 --> 00:02:01,483
It is still haunted by substance.

34
00:02:01,563 --> 00:02:05,097
It thinks of everything
as made of one luminosity,

35
00:02:05,177 --> 00:02:09,322
one clarity that colours,
sounds and thoughts are made of.

36
00:02:09,402 --> 00:02:13,851
The seer has merged, but the "one"
it merged into is still a something.

37
00:02:14,657 --> 00:02:16,506
That is what anatta changes.

38
00:02:16,586 --> 00:02:19,522
Oneness merges the seer into everything.

39
00:02:19,602 --> 00:02:22,158
Anatta finds no seer there to merge.

40
00:02:22,238 --> 00:02:27,068
With nothing merged, no "one" is
left for everything to be made of.

41
00:02:27,885 --> 00:02:30,278
In this taste there is no "made of".

42
00:02:30,358 --> 00:02:32,220
The colour is clear as colour.

43
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:34,068
The sound is clear as sound.

44
00:02:34,148 --> 00:02:36,677
Each is complete with its own conditions:

45
00:02:36,757 --> 00:02:41,093
light and eye for the colour,
air and ear for the sound.

46
00:02:41,173 --> 00:02:45,114
Six clarities, one for
each stream: seeing,

47
00:02:45,194 --> 00:02:49,449
hearing, smelling, tasting,
touching and thinking.

48
00:02:49,529 --> 00:02:51,681
Not one lamp lighting them all.

49
00:02:52,489 --> 00:02:56,716
So the test is simple. Is there a
"one" that everything is made of?

50
00:02:56,796 --> 00:02:59,125
If so, substance is still there.

51
00:02:59,933 --> 00:03:02,815
At the same time, the
factors are intimate.

52
00:03:02,895 --> 00:03:07,149
The colour is there only with
light, with the eye, with attention.

53
00:03:07,229 --> 00:03:11,537
The sound only with the air,
the ear, and the car going by.

54
00:03:11,617 --> 00:03:14,450
None of these stands
outside, feeding it in.

55
00:03:15,273 --> 00:03:17,367
So three things are found together.

56
00:03:17,447 --> 00:03:19,704
Effortless: no one is doing it.

57
00:03:19,784 --> 00:03:23,535
Seamless: nothing strings it
together from moment to moment.

58
00:03:23,615 --> 00:03:26,375
Intimate: the factors are not outside it.

59
00:03:26,455 --> 00:03:29,491
The alignment of these
factors is the appearing.

60
00:03:30,341 --> 00:03:31,543
Three cautions.

61
00:03:31,687 --> 00:03:35,588
"Just colours" does not leave
an object standing out there;

62
00:03:35,668 --> 00:03:39,165
the colour too is singled
out, in dependence.

63
00:03:39,295 --> 00:03:44,052
"Alignment" is not two steps,
factors first and then a lining up.

64
00:03:44,132 --> 00:03:47,041
And "not a process" does not deny change.

65
00:03:47,121 --> 00:03:51,203
What is not found is a process
as a thing, running underneath.

66
00:03:52,038 --> 00:03:55,097
This taste does not stay
in seeing and hearing.

67
00:03:55,177 --> 00:04:00,898
After anatta it widens, often by
itself, before I had any view for it.

68
00:04:00,978 --> 00:04:03,104
I found myself living within it.

69
00:04:03,909 --> 00:04:06,614
Each event seems to
spend itself completely.

70
00:04:06,694 --> 00:04:09,657
The sound of a car going
by is wholly the sound.

71
00:04:09,737 --> 00:04:12,130
Nothing is behind it, holding back.

72
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:16,791
Boundaries lose their solidity,
yet distinctions never disappear.

73
00:04:16,871 --> 00:04:20,246
The car is still the car,
more vivid than before.

74
00:04:21,062 --> 00:04:26,105
Dōgen called this total exertion: each
thing spending itself fully in its own

75
00:04:26,185 --> 00:04:27,232
place.

76
00:04:27,312 --> 00:04:32,450
Firewood abides in its own place,
and ash in its own. Each is complete.

77
00:04:32,530 --> 00:04:35,008
No wider whole stands behind it.

78
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:37,322
Here I have to be careful.

79
00:04:37,402 --> 00:04:43,402
Total exertion is easily heard as "the
whole cosmos is present in each moment".

80
00:04:43,802 --> 00:04:48,382
That is holism. It only makes the
whole the ground instead of the parts.

81
00:04:48,462 --> 00:04:52,350
The event spends itself
completely, with nothing held back,

82
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:54,786
and no cosmos packed inside it.

83
00:04:55,593 --> 00:04:58,271
It is not a second taste beside the first.

84
00:04:58,351 --> 00:05:00,594
It is the same taste, widening.

85
00:05:00,674 --> 00:05:06,192
In seeing and hearing I spoke of it as
spontaneous presence: nothing making it.

86
00:05:06,272 --> 00:05:09,983
Spreading through each
event, it is total exertion:

87
00:05:10,063 --> 00:05:11,722
nothing standing apart.

88
00:05:11,802 --> 00:05:14,430
Already two descriptions of one taste.

89
00:05:15,266 --> 00:05:17,229
But a taste is not yet freedom.

90
00:05:18,054 --> 00:05:22,662
The taste is effortless, and still
the mind has not released its habit of

91
00:05:22,742 --> 00:05:25,900
reifying. Ignorance has not been unbound.

92
00:05:26,709 --> 00:05:28,558
How can both be there at once?

93
00:05:28,638 --> 00:05:30,705
Because they are not in the same place.

94
00:05:30,785 --> 00:05:34,129
The taste is in the
immediacy of the senses.

95
00:05:34,209 --> 00:05:38,277
The habit is in how the world is
understood around that moment.

96
00:05:39,097 --> 00:05:43,922
While I see a flower, the seeing is
just colours, with no one behind it.

97
00:05:44,002 --> 00:05:48,242
Yet the moment I turn away, the flower
is still assumed to be sitting there by

98
00:05:48,322 --> 00:05:50,973
itself, its red belonging to it.

99
00:05:51,053 --> 00:05:53,799
A cause is still felt to push its effect.

100
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:56,123
Death is still the end of a someone.

101
00:05:56,203 --> 00:05:59,551
The self had dissolved,
but the universe had not.

102
00:06:00,446 --> 00:06:03,505
For years after anatta,
the taste was there,

103
00:06:03,585 --> 00:06:07,690
and the view still treated each
thing as standing by itself.

104
00:06:07,770 --> 00:06:10,719
That gap is what I call
the desynchronisation.

105
00:06:10,799 --> 00:06:13,301
The experience was free of substance.

106
00:06:13,381 --> 00:06:15,357
The framework was still full of it.

107
00:06:16,174 --> 00:06:18,377
The habit does not announce itself.

108
00:06:18,457 --> 00:06:20,048
It does not feel like a view.

109
00:06:20,128 --> 00:06:22,091
It feels like the world itself.

110
00:06:22,909 --> 00:06:27,394
It is only when it is challenged by
Nāgārjuna's verses that these habits come

111
00:06:27,474 --> 00:06:30,723
to the surface. That is
what the logic is for.

112
00:06:30,803 --> 00:06:33,929
Not to give a better taste,
but to bring the habit up,

113
00:06:34,009 --> 00:06:36,923
and then to unwind it, case by case.

114
00:06:37,721 --> 00:06:39,978
The logic does not do this alone.

115
00:06:40,058 --> 00:06:42,056
The habit is deeper than thought.

116
00:06:42,136 --> 00:06:45,399
It is in perception itself,
and even in the body.

117
00:06:45,479 --> 00:06:48,311
No argument unbinds that by being won.

118
00:06:49,125 --> 00:06:51,382
The logic points to the place to look.

119
00:06:51,462 --> 00:06:54,031
Then I look, and check
it against the taste.

120
00:06:54,111 --> 00:06:56,585
Is a whole found apart from its parts?

121
00:06:56,665 --> 00:06:58,325
Is a cause found pushing?

122
00:06:58,405 --> 00:07:01,952
Each time the answer is
seen, not only agreed to,

123
00:07:02,032 --> 00:07:03,827
the habit loosens a little.

124
00:07:03,907 --> 00:07:07,346
Insight without the logic
drifts back into nouns.

125
00:07:07,426 --> 00:07:11,495
Logic without the taste stays
a clever argument about words.

126
00:07:12,313 --> 00:07:17,341
Nāgārjuna makes the same move
as anatta, again and again.

127
00:07:17,421 --> 00:07:20,711
No seer behind seeing.
No goer behind going.

128
00:07:20,791 --> 00:07:22,817
No fire apart from its fuel.

129
00:07:22,897 --> 00:07:26,553
And in his first chapter,
no producer behind arising.

130
00:07:26,633 --> 00:07:29,067
A self is the doer behind the doing.

131
00:07:29,147 --> 00:07:33,541
A causal power is the doer behind
the causing. Neither is found.

132
00:07:34,362 --> 00:07:37,326
The bridge for me was Nāgasena's chariot.

133
00:07:37,406 --> 00:07:40,383
The chariot is not found
apart from its parts,

134
00:07:40,463 --> 00:07:42,271
and not as the parts either.

135
00:07:42,351 --> 00:07:44,472
It is designated in dependence.

136
00:07:44,552 --> 00:07:48,671
In that, the taste of total
exertion recognised itself.

137
00:07:48,751 --> 00:07:53,902
What I had tasted as "each event wholly
this" is what the logic says as "nothing

138
00:07:53,982 --> 00:07:56,121
here stands from its own side".

139
00:07:56,937 --> 00:07:59,207
And then the logic turns on itself.

140
00:07:59,287 --> 00:08:01,585
Dependence too is not found.

141
00:08:01,665 --> 00:08:06,408
The conditions are not a web, or a
basement on which appearances are built.

142
00:08:06,488 --> 00:08:08,193
Conditions are the appearing.

143
00:08:09,026 --> 00:08:12,891
Before that freedom, the mind
will always hinge on something.

144
00:08:13,737 --> 00:08:15,478
First it hinges on parts.

145
00:08:15,558 --> 00:08:17,530
A thing is made of its pieces.

146
00:08:17,610 --> 00:08:22,299
When the parts are seen through, it
does not let go. It hinges on the whole.

147
00:08:22,379 --> 00:08:26,592
When the whole is seen through, it
finds something finer to stand on.

148
00:08:26,672 --> 00:08:31,103
Qi, energy, a field,
relations, a substrate.

149
00:08:31,183 --> 00:08:34,070
Each time, it is looking for a foundation.

150
00:08:34,882 --> 00:08:37,262
The tools meet each hinge in turn.

151
00:08:37,342 --> 00:08:41,501
The chariot is not found among
its parts, nor apart from them.

152
00:08:41,581 --> 00:08:44,993
Qi and energy are not a
stuff under appearances.

153
00:08:45,073 --> 00:08:48,525
They are singled out and
designated like everything else.

154
00:08:48,605 --> 00:08:51,895
A field is the whole
again, in a softer form.

155
00:08:51,975 --> 00:08:53,865
Relations are not found either.

156
00:08:53,945 --> 00:08:58,172
And a substrate is the foundation
the mind was looking for all along.

157
00:08:58,252 --> 00:08:59,603
It is not found.

158
00:09:00,422 --> 00:09:04,282
When all of these are exhausted,
neither parts nor whole,

159
00:09:04,363 --> 00:09:09,758
with nothing left to hinge on, the mind
becomes free from all elaborations,

160
00:09:09,838 --> 00:09:13,540
and in a stable way. The
habit itself has unwound.

161
00:09:14,370 --> 00:09:17,606
Stable does not mean the
habit can never stir again.

162
00:09:17,686 --> 00:09:20,907
When it stirs, it is
met by the same seeing,

163
00:09:20,987 --> 00:09:23,357
and it does not take root as it did.

164
00:09:24,177 --> 00:09:27,589
Then appearance is again
tasted as vividly present,

165
00:09:27,669 --> 00:09:29,681
spontaneous and free.

166
00:09:29,761 --> 00:09:32,471
This is the first taste, revisited.

167
00:09:33,277 --> 00:09:37,477
It is the same taste. What has changed
is the understanding around it,

168
00:09:37,557 --> 00:09:42,816
and two things more. Reach: at first
the taste lived in seeing and hearing.

169
00:09:42,896 --> 00:09:46,784
Now it covers thought,
the body, things, causes,

170
00:09:46,864 --> 00:09:49,039
space, time and death.

171
00:09:49,119 --> 00:09:53,401
And stability: at first the habit
took it back when I stopped looking.

172
00:09:53,481 --> 00:09:55,579
Now it no longer depends on looking.

173
00:09:56,406 --> 00:10:00,688
Take away the doer from everything,
and put nothing in its place.

174
00:10:00,768 --> 00:10:03,201
Not even dependence kept as a new thing.

175
00:10:03,281 --> 00:10:05,348
Then nothing is making the appearing.

176
00:10:05,428 --> 00:10:08,215
The sound of a car going
by is not a product.

177
00:10:08,295 --> 00:10:12,866
It shows up whole and vivid,
exactly as its conditions meet.

178
00:10:13,690 --> 00:10:17,999
That is what spontaneous presence
means to me. It is not uncaused.

179
00:10:18,079 --> 00:10:21,817
Every appearing has its
conditions. And it is not a source.

180
00:10:21,897 --> 00:10:24,987
Nothing stands behind
appearing, giving it off.

181
00:10:25,801 --> 00:10:29,104
Mind and matter lose their
weight, and become light,

182
00:10:29,184 --> 00:10:31,142
magical and plastic.

183
00:10:31,222 --> 00:10:35,123
Ignorance sees the coming together
of conditions as production:

184
00:10:35,203 --> 00:10:38,044
something there first,
making something else.

185
00:10:38,124 --> 00:10:41,264
But nothing is made, and
nothing is handed on.

186
00:10:41,344 --> 00:10:45,367
And what appears is neither mind
nor matter from its own side.

187
00:10:45,447 --> 00:10:47,478
Each word cuts it from one side.

188
00:10:48,293 --> 00:10:52,751
After freedom from all elaborations,
I re-enter the marketplace,

189
00:10:52,831 --> 00:10:54,535
and dirty my hands.

190
00:10:55,366 --> 00:10:58,017
The marketplace is ordinary life.

191
00:10:58,097 --> 00:11:03,724
Work, family, money, arguments,
other people's troubles, choices.

192
00:11:03,804 --> 00:11:06,903
The last of the Zen
ox-herding pictures shows it:

193
00:11:06,983 --> 00:11:10,803
barefoot and bare-chested,
smeared with mud and ashes,

194
00:11:10,883 --> 00:11:14,802
he comes into the market with
helping hands, smiling broadly.

195
00:11:15,613 --> 00:11:20,456
Why after freedom? Because one can only
re-enter a place one has been free of.

196
00:11:20,558 --> 00:11:23,812
Freedom does not stay
apart. It goes back to work.

197
00:11:24,644 --> 00:11:27,240
Here dependent arising changes its role.

198
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:31,670
Before, it was the tool that brought
each hinge up and took it apart.

199
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:34,795
Now I deal in causes
and conditions all day:

200
00:11:34,875 --> 00:11:38,260
what helps, what harms,
what follows from what.

201
00:11:38,340 --> 00:11:40,923
Dependent arising is how help works.

202
00:11:41,003 --> 00:11:45,288
And a freedom that holds only
in quiet is not yet stable.

203
00:11:46,114 --> 00:11:48,263
Who decides, if no one is there?

204
00:11:48,343 --> 00:11:49,988
Nobody disappears.

205
00:11:50,068 --> 00:11:54,988
I still act, choose, keep my
promises and answer for what I do,

206
00:11:55,068 --> 00:11:56,754
as a conventional person.

207
00:11:56,834 --> 00:12:00,640
What is gone is the doer behind
the doing, pulling the levers.

208
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:05,658
Responsibility is answered first,
and nothing in the taste cancels it.

209
00:12:05,788 --> 00:12:09,336
"No one is there, so nothing
matters" is not freedom.

210
00:12:09,416 --> 00:12:11,202
It is the annihilation view.

211
00:12:12,025 --> 00:12:14,771
And why help, if others are not found?

212
00:12:14,851 --> 00:12:18,996
Their suffering still functions,
and it arises in dependence.

213
00:12:19,076 --> 00:12:21,945
Because it is not fixed, it can be eased.

214
00:12:22,025 --> 00:12:25,509
A suffering that stood by
itself could not be touched.

215
00:12:26,309 --> 00:12:30,527
So, looked back on, the taste
has been met three times.

216
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:36,269
First, anatta, around
1997: no seer, in seeing.

217
00:12:36,349 --> 00:12:40,115
Then the desynchronisation, and
the work of syncing the view.

218
00:12:40,195 --> 00:12:45,617
Second, freedom from all elaborations,
when every hinge is exhausted:

219
00:12:45,697 --> 00:12:48,593
the same taste, stable and wide.

220
00:12:48,673 --> 00:12:53,815
And third, dependent arising and
emptiness, in the marketplace.

221
00:12:54,646 --> 00:12:56,754
These are not stages of the taste.

222
00:12:56,834 --> 00:12:59,213
The logic does not produce the taste.

223
00:12:59,293 --> 00:13:00,898
It unbinds the habit.

224
00:13:00,978 --> 00:13:03,099
And it is not a ladder climbed once.

225
00:13:03,179 --> 00:13:07,678
It goes round more than once,
wherever the habit of fixing returns.

226
00:13:07,758 --> 00:13:12,016
Each turn clarifies one seeing,
rather than adding a floor.

227
00:13:12,829 --> 00:13:15,887
All views and understanding
here are my own,

228
00:13:15,967 --> 00:13:18,319
from my practice and contemplation.

229
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:22,400
I do not represent any
tradition, school or teacher.

230
00:13:23,201 --> 00:13:27,419
Next: one taste, many
faces. That is Part 5.

